# Contact form — Web3Forms access key.
# Get a free key at https://web3forms.com (enter the inbox address you want
# submissions sent to; no account needed). Then set this variable:
#   - locally: copy this file to .env and paste the key
#   - on Netlify: Site settings → Environment variables → add VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY
# Until it is set, the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
